    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/wedding-planner-blocks/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Wedding Planner Blocks Theme is a beautifully designed and highly functional theme crafted specifically for wedding planners, event organizers, and bridal consultants who want to create an elegant and visually stunning wedding website. This versatile template is ideal for showcasing wedding planning services, including venue selection, catering, floral arrangements, decoration ideas, and complete event management solutions. It features a modern and beautiful design with customizable content blocks that allow you to present services, testimonials, photo galleries, wedding packages, and themed event setups in a clear and engaging way. Built with a drag-and-drop page builder plugin, it enables effortless customization of layouts, colors, and sections without coding, making it accessible for both beginners and professionals. The responsive structure ensures a seamless experience across desktops, tablets, and smartphones, while integrated booking forms, pricing tables, and contact pages help convert visitors into clients. Social media integration enhances visibility and engagement, allowing planners to promote every wedding event effectively. Optimized for SEO and fast performance, the theme improves search rankings and online reach. Whether you’re offering full wedding planning, consultation services, or bridal product sales, Wedding Planner Blocks provides an elegant, beautiful, and professional platform to create a complete and engaging wedding event website."
    },
